      "text": "fear and tremble, O ye people, D&C 1:7. the Lord will cause to tremble those who build kingdom of devil, D&C 10:56. suffering caused even God to tremble, D&C 19:18. all nations shall tremble at the Lord’s coming, D&C 34:8 (133:42). Satan shall tremble, D&C 35:24. when the Lord utters his voice, earth shall tremble, D&C 43:18 (45:48). when the Lord appears, enemies shall tremble, D&C 45:74. look forth for earth to tremble, D&C 49:23 (88:87). nations of earth shall tremble because of Zion, D&C 64:43. starry heavens shall tremble, D&C 84:118. dark deeds make hands of very devil to tremble, D&C 123:10. boundaries of everlasting hills shall tremble, D&C 133:31.",
